; One variable: NoiseTexture2D's as_normal_map arm as SAMPLED BY LIGHTING —
; bump_to_normal_map's sign/packing and the NoColorSpace tagging only show up
; when a lit material perturbs its normals with the result. The other noise
; golden (unit-noisetexture2d.tscn) is an unlit 2D colour-ramp field, so a
; regression here (flipped green channel, sRGB-bent normals, row order) is
; invisible in it and in every other scene.
